  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"MapSessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>MapSessionFactoryLookup</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"MapSessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup 中的类\"><code>MapSessionFactoryLookup</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a>; the keys are <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>, the values\nare actual <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "设置一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，其键为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>，值为实际的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>实例；该 Map 用于存储<code>session factories</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the supplied <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> to the map of <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a> maintained by this\nobject.",
      "translation": "将提供的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>添加到由本对象维护的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a>映射中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a> maintained by this object.",
      "translation": "获取由该对象维护的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，其中包含<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must implement this method to retrieve the <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> identified by the given name from\ntheir backing store.",
      "translation": "实现类必须实现此方法，以从其存储中检索给定名称所标识的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>sessionFactoryName</code> - the name under which the supplied <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> is to be added",
      "translation": "<code>sessionFactoryName</code> - 要添加提供的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>的名称",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Useful for testing environments or applications that need to match arbitrary <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> names to target\n<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> objects. This class is not thread-safe for modifications. Once initialized, it can be shared\namongst multiple threads and is thread-safe for reading.",
      "translation": "适用于测试环境或需要匹配任意<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>名称以指向目标<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>对象的应用程序。此类在修改时不是线程安全的。一旦初始化，它可以在多个线程之间共享，并且在读取时是线程安全的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>unmodifiable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a> 是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>不可变</code></a> 的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> is null, then this method call effectively has no effect.",
      "translation": "如果提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>为 null，则此方法调用实际上没有任何效果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"SessionFactoryLookup.html#getSessionFactory(java.lang.String)\">SessionFactoryLookup</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"SessionFactoryLookup.html#getSessionFactory(java.lang.String)\">SessionFactoryLookup</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>sessionFactories</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a>. The keys are <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>, the values are actual <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "<code>sessionFactories</code> - 一个包含<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>session factories</code></a>。键为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>，值为实际的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
